  "title": "Noodles Romanoff II",
  "description": "Sour cream and Parmesan cheese give a tart edge to the creaminess of this egg noodle dish. Chopped chives and a clove of garlic add sparks of color and an earthy tone. Serve hot with more Parmesan sprinkled over the top.",
